# Longitudinal Author Cocitation Mapping: The Changing Structure of Macroeconomics.

**Authors:** McCain, Katherine W.

## Abstract
Author cocitation analysis was used to investigate changes in intellectual structure of macroeconomics over two consecutive time periods, 1972-1977 and 1978-1983. Profile analysis, nonmetric multidimensional scaling, and clustering techniques were used to create two-dimensional maps displaying changing relationships among 41 authors as perceived by scholars citing their work. (34 references) (Author/EJS)

